      },
      "text": "```\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| HINDI / URDU (हिन्दी / اردو) — Hindustani                           |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Family:      Indo-European → Indo-Iranian → Indic                 |\n| Native spkrs: Hindi ~344M + Urdu ~92M = ~436M Hindustani          |\n| Total spkrs:  ~600M (including L2)                                 |\n| Countries:   India (Hindi official), Pakistan (Urdu official)      |\n|              Widely spoken: Bangladesh, Nepal, diaspora worldwide  |\n| Word order:  SOV (Subject-Object-Verb) — strict                   |\n| Morphology:  Fusional                                              |\n| Tonal:       No                                                    |\n| Gender:      Binary (M/F)                                          |\n| Script:      Hindi → Devanagari; Urdu → Nastaliq (Arabic-derived) |\n| Cases:       2 direct/oblique + postpositions carry case meaning   |\n| FSI level:   Category III — ~1100 hours (harder for Urdu script)   |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------+"
    },
    {
