        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "INDEPENDENT VOWELS (used at start of word or after another vowel):\n  अ [a]  आ [ā]  इ [i]  ई [ī]  उ [u]  ऊ [ū]\n  ए [e]  ऐ [ai] ओ [o]  औ [au]  ऋ [ṛ]"
    },
    {
