        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CONSONANTS with inherent 'a' vowel:\nRow 1 (velar):   क [ka]  ख [kha]  ग [ga]  घ [gha]  ङ [ṅa]\nRow 2 (palatal): च [ca]  छ [cha]  ज [ja]  झ [jha]  ञ [ña]\nRow 3 (retroflex):ट [ṭa] ठ [ṭha] ड [ḍa]  ढ [ḍha]  ण [ṇa]\nRow 4 (dental):  त [ta]  थ [tha]  द [da]  ध [dha]  न [na]\nRow 5 (labial):  प [pa]  फ [pha]  ब [ba]  भ [bha]  म [ma]\nSemi-vowels:     य [ya]  र [ra]   ल [la]  व [va/wa]\nSibilants:       श [śa]  ष [ṣa]   स [sa]  ह [ha]"
    },
