      "text": "ASPIRATED vs UNASPIRATED — Hindi distinguishes these phonemically:\n  क ka vs ख kha   ग ga vs घ gha   प pa vs फ pha   ब ba vs भ bha\n  English speakers hear \"ka\" and \"kha\" as the same — they are not.\n  \"Kha\" has a puff of air; \"ka\" doesn't.\n```"
