      "text": "ASPIRATED vs UNASPIRATED — phonemic in Hindi, allophonic in English:\n  English \"p\" in \"pin\" is aspirated [pʰ] — same as Hindi फ.\n  English \"p\" in \"spin\" is unaspirated [p] — same as Hindi प.\n  In English these are allophones (same phoneme in different environments).\n  In Hindi they are DIFFERENT PHONEMES (change word meaning)."
