      },
      "text": "```\nHINDI CASE SYSTEM — simplified but with postpositions\n======================================================\nTwo main forms: DIRECT (subject, direct object) and OBLIQUE (before postposition)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-HINDI-URDU.md#023",
      "path": [
        "08-HINDI-URDU.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:world-languages:08-hindi-urdu, git-history:world-languages:08-hindi-urdu]",
        "canonical_path": "world-languages/08-HINDI-URDU.md",
        "concepts": "[hindi, urdu]",
        "current_path": "world-languages/08-HINDI-URDU.md",
        "id": "maxim:world-languages:hindi-urdu",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "world-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[hindi, urdu]",
        "section": "world-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Postpositions (after nouns, unlike English prepositions):\n  को  ko   — to, for (marks indirect object or animate DO)\n  का  kā   — of (possession, also kī/ke for agreement)\n  में  mẽ   — in\n  पर  par  — on\n  से  se   — from, by, with, than\n  तक  tak  — until, up to\n  के लिए ke liye — for the purpose of"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-HINDI-URDU.md#024",
      "path": [
        "08-HINDI-URDU.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:world-languages:08-hindi-urdu, git-history:world-languages:08-hindi-urdu]",
        "canonical_path": "world-languages/08-HINDI-URDU.md",
        "concepts": "[hindi, urdu]",
        "current_path": "world-languages/08-HINDI-URDU.md",
        "id": "maxim:world-languages:hindi-urdu",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "world-languages",
