        "root_concepts": "[hindi, urdu]",
        "section": "world-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "OBLIQUE case:\n  Direct:   लड़का (laṛkā, boy)    → Oblique: लड़के (laṛke)\n  Direct:   लड़की (laṛkī, girl)   → Oblique: लड़की (unchanged)\n  Direct:   घर (ghar, house)     → Oblique: घर (unchanged)\n  Direct:   मेज़ (mez, table)     → Oblique: मेज़ (unchanged)"
    },
    {
