        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "\"The boy\" = लड़का laṛkā (direct)\n\"to the boy\" = लड़के को laṛke ko (oblique + ko postposition)\n\"of the boy\" = लड़के का laṛke kā (oblique + kā)\n```"
    },
