      "text": "```\nGRAMMATICAL GENDER — and its cascade of agreement\n===================================================\nMasculine: typically ends in -ā in direct singular\n  लड़का laṛkā (boy), घर ghar (house, invariable), आदमी ādmī (man)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-HINDI-URDU.md#028",
