        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Feminine: typically ends in -ī or -ī/i\n  लड़की laṛkī (girl), किताब kitāb (book, invariable)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-HINDI-URDU.md#029",
      "path": [
