      "text": "AGREEMENT cascades to:\n  1. Adjectives: बड़ा (m) / बड़ी (f) / बड़े (m.plur) = big\n  2. Verbs (in perfective): agree with subject gender/number\n  3. Postposition का: kā (m) / kī (f) / ke (m.plur)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-HINDI-URDU.md#030",
