        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Hindi–Urdu - Language Reference",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Example:\n  बड़ा लड़का गया। (baṛā laṛkā gayā.) — The big boy went. (m.sing)\n  बड़ी लड़की गई। (baṛī laṛkī gaī.) — The big girl went. (f.sing)\n  बड़े लड़के गए। (baṛe laṛke gae.) — The big boys went. (m.plur)\n```"
